":"大通二年，魏郢州刺史元願達請降，高祖敕郢州刺史元樹往迎願達，夔亦自楚城會之，遂留鎮焉。詔改魏郢州爲北司州，以夔爲刺史，兼督司州。三年，遷使持節，進號仁威將軍，封保城縣侯，邑一千五百戶。中大通二年，徵爲右衛將軍，丁所生母憂去職。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003:m0010"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003","text":"大通二年，魏郢州刺史元願達請降，高祖敕郢州刺史元樹往迎願達，夔亦自楚城會之，遂留鎮焉。詔改魏郢州爲北司州，以夔爲刺史，兼督司州。三年，遷使持節，進號仁威將軍，封保城縣侯，邑一千五百戶。中大通二年，徵爲右衛將軍，丁所生母憂去職。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"raw_start":4707,"raw_end":4827,"raw_character_offsets":[4707,4708,4709,4710,4711,4712,4713,4714,4715,4716,4717,4718,4719,4720,4721,4722,4723,4724,4725,4726,4727,4728,4729,4730,4731,4732,4733,4734,4735,4736,4737,4738,4739,4740,4741,4742,4743,4744,4745,4746,4747,4748,4749,4750,4751,4752,4753,4754,4755,4756,4757,4758,4759,4760,4761,4762,4763,4764,4765,4766,4767,4768,4769,4770,4771,4772,4773,4774,4775,4776,4777,4778,4779,4780,4781,4782,4783,4784,4785,4786,4787,4788,4789,4790,4791,4792,4793,4794,4795,4796,4797,4798,4804,4805,4806,4807,4808,4811,4812,4813,4814,4815,4816,4817,4818,4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,4826],"revision_id":1511902},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003:m0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"元願達","kind":"person","person_id":"zbr_1m4_7pb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"元樹","kind":"person","person_id":"h9d_f3h_20h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003: